          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The lowest-sodium protein powders are the plainest ones: unflavored whey isolate at around 30 to 50 mg per serving, and pressed plant proteins like hemp and almond at close to nothing. NOW Sports Whey Isolate is the best everyday buy, Klean Isolate the certified upgrade, and Bob's Red Mill Almond Protein the dairy-free choice that avoids the sodium common in pea isolates.
          </p>
